{"id":"rp2057","designation":"RP 2057","title":"Text-Based MetadataCarriage in MXF","state":"active","suite":null,"official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/rp2057/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/rp2057/","checked_at":"2026-11-18"},"scope":"This document defines how to carry text-based metadata with a specified text MIME type encoded using either Unicode UTF-8 or UTF-16 character encoding (such as XML) in a MXF file. This standard defines two methods of text-based metadata carriage. The first method is to carry text-based metadata using the MXF Generic Stream Partition defined in SMPTE ST 410. The second method is to carry it in the MXF Header Metadata by defining a DM Framework which includes Text-based Sets. This document specifies the Generic Stream Partition Pack for several text-based metadata formats including the KLV coding of the Generic Stream Data Element, and DM Schemes including DM Framework, Sets and Items for text-based metadata.","outline":[{"level":1,"title":"1 Scope","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"2 Conformance Notation","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"3 Normative References","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"4 Definition of Acronyms, Terms and Data Types","page":4},{"level":1,"title":"5 General (Informative)","page":4},{"level":1,"title":"6 Generic Stream Partition for Text-based Metadata","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"6.1 Generic Stream Partition Pack","page":5},{"level":3,"title":"6.1.1 Generic Stream Partition Pack Key","page":5},{"level":3,"title":"6.1.2 Generic Stream Partition Pack Length","page":5},{"level":3,"title":"6.1.3 Generic Stream Partition Pack Values","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"6.2 Generic Stream Data Element coding","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"6.2.1 Generic Stream Data Element Key","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"6.2.2 Generic Stream Data Element Length","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"6.2.3 Generic Stream Data Element Value","page":6},{"level":2,"title":"6.3 Generic Stream Constraints","page":7},{"level":1,"title":"7 Descriptive Metadata Scheme and Sets for Text-Based Metadata","page":7},{"level":2,"title":"7.1 Universal Label for Descriptive Metadata Scheme","page":7},{"level":2,"title":"7.2 Descriptive Metadata Set definitions","page":7},{"level":3,"title":"7.2.1 Descriptive Metadata Set Keys","page":7},{"level":3,"title":"7.2.2 Text-Based DM Framework","page":8},{"level":3,"title":"7.2.3 Text-based Object","page":8},{"level":3,"title":"7.2.4 Generic Stream Text-based Set","page":9},{"level":3,"title":"7.2.5 UTF-8 Text-based Set","page":10},{"level":3,"title":"7.2.6 UTF-16 Text-based Set","page":10},{"level":1,"title":"8 Guideline on Text-Based Metadata Implementation","page":10},{"level":2,"title":"8.1 Selection of Carriage Mechanism","page":10},{"level":2,"title":"8.2 Text-Based Metadata identification","page":11},{"level":2,"title":"8.3 Header Metadata Implementation (Informative)","page":11},{"level":3,"title":"8.3.1 Text-Based Metadata carriage in Generic Stream Payload","page":11},{"level":3,"title":"8.3.2 Text-Based Metadata carriage in the Header Metadata","page":13}],"definitions":[],"keywords":[{"term":"Metadata","zh":"元数据","abbr":"","category":"metadata","source":"curated"},{"term":"Key-Length-Value","zh":"键-长度-值","abbr":"KLV","category":"metadata","source":"curated"},{"term":"Extensible Markup Language","zh":"可扩展标记语言","abbr":"XML","category":"metadata","source":"curated"},{"term":"BER","zh":"","abbr":"BER","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"UTF","zh":"","abbr":"UTF","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"UID","zh":"","abbr":"UID","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"MIME","zh":"","abbr":"MIME","category":"other","source":"acronym"}],"refs":[{"id":"st410","designation":"ST 410"},{"id":"st377-1","designation":"ST 377-1"},{"id":"st336","designation":"ST 336"},{"id":"st395","designation":"ST 395"},{"id":"st400","designation":"ST 400"},{"id":"rp224","designation":"RP 224"},{"id":"st298","designation":"ST 298"},{"id":"rp210","designat